Shawnee Forest Day Hike Trail — East Loop		Hiking			7.2	Scioto	Ohio Department of Natural Resources, Division of Forestry					The East Loop of the Shawnee State Forest Day Hike Trail system, blazed in blue. A 7.2-mile loop through Shawnee State Forest ridges and hollows designed for day hiking without backpacking gear.		Parent: Shawnee State Forest (SC-S-0004 pending). Blue blaze confirmed. Length 7.2 miles confirmed. Companion to West Loop (SC-T-0008 pending). Distinct from Shawnee Backpack Trail (SC-T-0001), which is orange-blazed and multi-day. ODNR formal trail name not confirmed — AllTrails name used.			https://www.alltrails.com/parks/us/ohio/shawnee-state-park	SC-T-0007
